{
  "analysis": "The HTML file has been created successfully. Now I need to create the CSS file for styling the layout, bubble chart, table, and tooltip.",
  "plan": "Create style.css with comprehensive styling for the two-column layout, bubble chart styling, table styling, tooltips, and legend.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat > /root/output/css/style.css << 'EOF'
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
    background-color: #f5f5f5;
    color: #333;
}

.container {
    max-width: 1600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 20px;
}

h1 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    color: #222;
    font-size: 28px;
}

h2 {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    color: #444;
}

.content {
    display: flex;
    gap: 30px;
    background-color: white;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}

.chart-container {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 500px;
}

.table-container {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 400px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    max-height: 800px;
}

#bubble-chart {
    width: 100%;
    height: 600px;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background-color: #fafafa;
}

.legend {
    margin-top: 15px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 15px;
}

.legend-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
}

.legend-color {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border-radius: 50%;
}

#stock-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 13px;
}

#stock-table thead {
    background-color: #f0f0f0;
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 10;
}

#stock-table th {
    padding: 12px 8px;
    text-align: left;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #ddd;
    color: #333;
}

#stock-table td {
    padding: 10px 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
}

#stock-table tbody tr {
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
}

#stock-table tbody tr:hover {
    background-color: #f9f9f9;
}

#stock-table tbody tr.highlighted {
    background-color: #fff3cd;
    font-weight: 500;
}

.tooltip {
    position: absolute;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
    color: white;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 12px;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1000;
    display: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
}

.tooltip.visible {
    display: block;
}

circle {
    cursor: pointer;
    stroke: white;
    stroke-width: 2px;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
}

circle:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
}

circle.highlighted {
    stroke: #333;
    stroke-width: 3px;
}

.bubble-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-anchor: middle;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
}

@media (max-width: 1200px) {
    .content {
        flex-direction: column;
    }

    .chart-container,
    .table-container {
        min-width: 100%;
    }
}
EOF
",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ],
  "task_complete": false
}
```

